ANCHOR: chemical-ecology + Bayesian-abduction
GRAPH: hidden_state → emission → receiver → behavior
INVERT: behavior → competing_hidden_causes
OPS: detect|triangulate|predict|test|Δ|preserve
INV: causality≠correlation; cue≠signal
EXPAND: molecules→organisms→ecosystems→systems
VERIFY: provenance + counterexamples + calibration
FRONTIER: unknown_receivers + emergent_grammar

That small seed directs a capable interpreter toward a substantially larger body of knowledge.

